  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;GENERAL WANG RUILIN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"General Wang Ruilin is a renowned Chinese general with decades of service, holding the prestigious rank of Jiang in the People's Liberation Army (PLA), known for his exceptional leadership and strategic acumen."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0309</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GENERAL LI ZUOCHENG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"General Li Zuocheng is the Chief of the Joint Staff Department of the Central Military Commission, who praised General Wang Ruilin's leadership and contributions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0309</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PEOPLE'S LIBERATION ARMY (PLA)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The People's Liberation Army (PLA) is the official armed forces of the People's Republic of China, where General Wang Ruilin serves and has been promoted to the rank of Jiang."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0309</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JIANG&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Jiang is a prestigious rank in the PLA, equivalent to a four-star general in Western militaries, reserved for high-ranking officers with exceptional leadership and service."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0309</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHINESE MINISTRY OF NATIONAL DEFENSE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Chinese Ministry of National Defense oversees the PLA and provided data on the number of Jiang-ranked officers in recent years."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0309</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SENIOR COLONEL WU QIAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Senior Colonel Wu Qian is a spokesperson for the Chinese Ministry of National Defense, who commented on General Wang Ruilin's promotion."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0309</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CANTON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Canton is a bustling city in southern China, where General Wang Ruilin is seen navigating the marketplace and waterfront."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0309</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROYAL NAVY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Royal Navy is the naval warfare branch of the British Armed Forces, represented by Lieutenant Fraser, who greets General Wang Ruilin aboard a ship."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0309</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LIEUTENANT FRASER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lieutenant Fraser is a member of the Royal Navy, serving aboard a ship and welcoming General Wang Ruilin during his visit."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0309</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNION JACK&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Union Jack is the flag of the United Kingdom, flown by the Royal Navy ship that General Wang Ruilin visits."&lt;SEP&gt;"Union Jack is the flag of the United Kingdom, flown by the Royal Navy ship, representing the ship's nationality and allegiance."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0309</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LONDON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"London is the destination of the ship that General Wang Ruilin visits, symbolizing his international connections and responsibilities."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0309</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BEIJING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Beijing is the capital city of China, where the news about General Wang Ruilin's promotion was confirmed."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0309</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PEARL RIVER&quot;">
